{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人林盛斌（Bob）向來以親民形象及超強吸金力見稱。</p><p>近日有網民於社交平台分享在街頭野生捕獲Bob的經歷，相中見他親自駕駛一輛價值逾百萬港元的黑色越野車，車頭更掛上以其英文名命名的「BOB」自訂車牌，在路上極具霸氣且辨識度十足。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:33:48.144599+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:21:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:26:54.146668+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:26:54.146668+00:00","content_hash":"b0d60df32d4c0d48337b7b0e8fcf339d41079798825ffd75d89942e1642e3e39","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}